# AuraTrade – On-Chain Trading Platform 🚀

A modern, high-performance Web3 trading product hero and dark glassmorphic analytics dashboard built with pure HTML, CSS, and Vanilla JavaScript.

## ✨ Features
- **Royal Violet Theme:** Immersive starfield canvas and screen-blended glow video effects.
- **Interactive Terminal Tabs:** Dynamic switching between Home, Ecosystem, Markets, Governance, and Analytics views.
- **Responsive Layout:** Fully optimized for desktops, tablets, and mobile screens with centered fluid elements.
- **Pure Vanilla Stack:** No frameworks, lightweight, and blazing fast.

## 🛠️ Tech Stack
- HTML5 & CSS3 (Flexbox, Grid, Glassmorphism)
- Vanilla JavaScript (DOM manipulation & dynamic view switching)
- HTML5 Canvas & Video API

